ebp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc4065280967d6028de72630fe2a1150", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/afb76fb3/uploads/origins/4c179c02-c74e-447f-89dd-594fd3484e25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc4065280967d6028de72630fe2a1150, https://si.imgix.net/afb76fb3/uploads/origins/4c179c02-c74e-447f-89dd-594fd3484e25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0606d079f8ccc0d99b82ec3bad24a0bf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/afb76fb3/uploads/origins/4c179c02-c74e-447f-89dd-594fd3484e25?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f9d6f3c5da666399d3a424b778b86b78 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きです！私のOCをセクシーなポーズで描いてくれませんか?細かいところはお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Z7vDTMvS797KXiUcJEumyb31o2KyDZhd", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kitaugetu/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa7a830/uploads/origins/2b892d40-22d5-4fdc-af10-4da82e07f257?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a5672c45744a09ed4161e98bbeaad0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1aa7a830/uploads/origins/2b892d40-22d5-4fdc-af10-4da82e07f257?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0a5672c45744a09ed4161e98bbeaad0, https://si.imgix.net/1aa7a830/uploads/origins/2b892d40-22d5-4fdc-af10-4da82e07f257?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2eb42d6f61863caf92d8b5a3b81cd133 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1aa7a830/uploads/origins/2b892d40-22d5-4fdc-af10-4da82e07f257?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7af2d41bd32db940454faa3971700c90 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵がとても好きなので、私のキャラクターを描いてほしいです。\nセクシーなポーズが希望ですが、あとはお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qAUIZ71SeOoKK2V-wbGFlNDkvNcfSBql?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kitauge